The other big events are the Hampton Players Championship at The Hamptons July 23-24, and the Greater Hampton Amateur at The Woodlands July 29-31.
''I'm ready to get started again,'' said Allen Barber of Yorktown, who dominated the 1993 season by winning the Warwick Amateur, the Pen-Am, the Hampton Players and the Greater Hampton Amateur.
The Williamsburg Country Club will play host to the VSGA Senior Four-Ball Championship April 25-26.
